# Cloudflare Workers static-assets exclusions.
# The deployment serves the repository root. Keep repository-only tooling,
# tests, database history, and backend source out of the public
# static asset upload while leaving browser/runtime assets untouched.

.git/
.github/

tests/
supabase/
scripts/

README.md
.gitignore
package.json
package-lock.json
wrangler.atlas-web.jsonc

shared/worker.js
shared/worker.cloudflare.js
arcade/forbidden-words/server/
arcade/forbidden-words/dev/
arcade/forbidden-words/README.md
**/node_modules/

